        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>plant axes (exact, plural)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>植物軸（軸柱） (Japanese, exact)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
